 "cues": [
  {
   "t0": 0.45,
   "t1": 4.14,
   "html": "Every network change starts as a drawing."
  },
  {
   "t0": 4.04,
   "t1": 10.6,
   "html": "And every outage starts with the gap between that drawing \u2014<br>and <em>what's actually on the box</em>."
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.15,
   "t1": 17.46,
   "html": "You design it in Visio. You build it by hand, in CLI."
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.36,
   "t1": 24.29,
   "html": "Somewhere between the two, a VLAN gets transposed.<br>A BGP neighbour never comes up."
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.19,
   "t1": 32.54,
   "html": "You find out at 2am \u2014 inside a maintenance window,<br>with no time left to use the rollback plan."
  },
  {
   "t0": 33.19,
   "t1": 37.83,
   "html": "The drawing was never wrong.<br>It was just never <em>connected to anything</em>."
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.73,
   "t1": 46.25,
   "html": "Every diagram tool gives you a picture of the network.<br>Then it hands you a keyboard and wishes you luck."
  },
  {
   "t0": 48.3,
   "t1": 51.76,
   "html": "So what if the drawing <em>was</em> the source of truth?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 51.66,
   "t1": 56.12,
   "html": "Not a picture of the network. The network itself."
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.97,
   "t1": 64.44,
   "html": "Drag a device onto the canvas."
  },
  {
   "t0": 65.47,
   "t1": 70.75,
   "html": "Connect the ports. Set your VLANs, your routing, your management."
  },
  {
   "t0": 71.97,
   "t1": 79.1,
   "html": "Scale the same canvas to a full <em>leaf-spine VXLAN EVPN fabric</em>."
  },
  {
   "t0": 79.0,
   "t1": 85.02,
   "html": "Cisco. Arista. Aruba. Palo Alto. Silver Peak. <em>One canvas.</em>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 85.47,
   "t1": 89.42,
   "html": "Before anything ships \u2014 it gets checked."
  },
  {
   "t0": 90.97,
   "t1": 97.67,
   "html": "IP conflicts. VLAN mismatches. BGP peer gaps. Spanning-tree errors."
  },
  {
   "t0": 97.57,
   "t1": 102.78,
   "html": "Caught <em>here</em>, on the canvas \u2014<br>not out there, in the maintenance window."
  },
  {
   "t0": 103.13,
   "t1": 114.53,
   "html": "Then the AI Network Architect reviews the whole design \u2014<br>and tells you what to fix."
  },
  {
   "t0": 120.38,
   "t1": 127.26,
   "html": "Production-ready CLI. AVD Ansible YAML.<br>Generated from the same canvas."
  },
  {
   "t0": 127.51,
   "t1": 138.2,
   "html": "PDF packages, Visio diagrams, Excel BOM, cable schedules \u2014<br>documentation that <em>can't drift</em> from the design."
  },
  {
   "t0": 138.45,
   "t1": 145.73,
   "html": "Reverse-engineer a live Azure subscription onto the canvas \u2014<br>and push it back as <em>Terraform</em>."
  }
 ],
